# [DD-13b.W1.3] A DELIVERING CALL ON A DEFINITION THAT EXPORTS NOTHING.
#
# The default IS nothing exported (D89 addendum point 2), so this is the shape
# a caller reaches by assuming the old rule — every named group delivered —
# which is exactly what that addendum withdrew. Refused rather than silently
# delivering zero rows: a delivering call that delivers nothing is the
# half-feature these rulings removed.
target = t

pattern ^(?&s=piece)$
name t

pattern (?<kept>a)
name piece
